+# Sigma workflow rules — live companion
+
+This is the mandatory live continuation of the workspace `AGENTS.md`, not an
+archive or optional reference. Read it completely before Sigma work. The root
+entry owns discovery and the critical execution summary; this file preserves
+the full workflow rules, commands, evidence gates and reporting requirements.
+Both form one instruction set. Direct user instructions and frozen contracts
+retain their existing precedence. Edit the applicable live rule here; update
