+Apply UI28 context revisions to reviewed operational rows, composed outputs and
+deferred confirmations: clear prior rows/counts/labels, cancel reads while
+retaining query triggers, and reject confirmations from an older revision even
+when the ID matches. Keep already sent writes independent and ignore their
+old-session local effects; never retry or cancel them as though they were reads.
