+on an invalidated context alongside read cancellation and clearing feature rows.
+It cancels only a scheduled frame, never an opened browser print dialog or an
+independent write. Keep the shared revision/destroy and afterPrint lifecycle;
+do not copy a feature scheduler or synthesize afterPrint.
