+explicitly derived results through the shared helper. Reconcile API/storage and
+all consumed types before allowing fractions.
+Use UI19's represented-decimal integer midpoint rounding owner for previews;
+never copy epsilon-plus-binary-multiply rounding into a feature. This does not
+make preceding floating arithmetic authoritative over backend decimal results.
